I'll start by examining the candidate in context to understand the validation function and the specific line that was changed.

{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "file_context",
  "arguments": {
    "path": "bottle.py",
    "line": 1990,
    "radius": 10,
    "revision": "head"
  },
  "reason": "Get context around the changed line to understand the validate function structure"
}

